# A cosmetic screw thread (an extension) on the side of an extruded
# circle, picked on the model: chosen on the thread screen, it makes the
# datum and one sketch, no helix, and its group's screen edits it. Made
# modelled from there, then undone in one step back to the cosmetic one.
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 80
view rotated
click-face face 2 of g003-extrude
menu Features|Screw Thread...
tw
# Cosmetic, then make it.
twmove 561 230
twdown L 561 230
twup L 561 230
tw
twmove 37 280
twdown L 37 280
twup L 37 280
dump
tw
# Its group's screen edits it: modelled.
twmove 228 110
twdown L 228 110
twup L 228 110
tw
twmove 453 230
twdown L 453 230
twup L 453 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
dump
tw
# Undo takes the edit back at once: the cosmetic thread again.
key z ctrl
dump
